  "source": "Hand-made test fixture of the time-series template (pipelines/time-series-forecasting.toml), not a recorded run. The data are real: NASA POWER monthly T2M at 50.11 N, 8.68 E, 2001-2023, recorded once live through e2er's connector (inputs/nasa_power_monthly_t2m.json) and loaded by make_fixture.py; the analysis script's results are computed from them; the plans, the forecast setup, the draft and the reviews are written for the test.",
